# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/metai.
# The counted noun's form keys off the numeral's last digit -- nominative
# singular after a numeral ending in 1, nominative plural after 2-9,
# genitive plural after 0 and 11-19 -- and the accusative is the form
# "prieš" (ago) imposes, so all of them are surfaces of this unit.
metai
metų
metus
metais
